WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.044
This is Walkcast. A free desktop app that turns one URL into a narrated walkthrough video.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.103
Open the app. Paste your link. Press record.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.900
A real browser walks your site - signs in, follows links, scrolls each page.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.376
You get the whole visit as an MP4, with captions, chapters and a transcript.

5
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.059
Every line comes from what actually happened - real browser, real state, real evidence.

6
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.765
When a page changes, you don't re-film anything. Paste the link again and Walkcast re-records.

7
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.934
The studio shows your video, transcript and page list side by side - share one link.

8
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.297
And when your browser agents fail, Walkcast Lab turns the failed run into a replayable regression test.

9
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.989
Capture the failure, classify the cause, freeze it, replay it - and know if the next version fixed it.

10
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:47.433
Pick your voice in settings - Kokoro is free and offline, or bring your own ElevenLabs or OpenAI key.

11
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:54.896
One URL. A finished video. Walkcast. Show what actually happened. Free and open source, at walkcast.kunjshah.in.

